│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Strategy:                                                                                 │
│                          │ - Return to a simpler, more structured design with better parameter utilization           │
│                          │ - Focus on nearest-neighbor and intermediate-range entanglement that naturally aligns     │
│                          │ with typical readout pair structures                                                      │
│                          │ - Remove low-utility gates (CRZ) and add more RX layers for better single-qubit           │
│                          │ expressivity                                                                              │
│                          │ - Reintroduce selective long-range couplings only where needed                            │
│                          │ - Target ~10-11 distinct parameters with better generalization                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This maintains parameter economy while improving the quality of learned representations   │
│                          │ and worst-group separation.                                                               │
