                         Patch Metadata - Gen 47/80 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 2/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ simplified_ansatz_with_balanced_entanglement                                              │
│ patch_description        │ The current program (score 0.51) has 7 distinct parameters but shows poor generalization  │
│                          │ with a gap of 0.15 between train and test accuracy, and worst_group_margin_mean of 0.36.  │
│                          │ The second prior program (score 0.60) achieved better results with a similar 7-parameter  │
│                          │ structure but simpler gate arrangement.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key observations:                                                                         │
│                          │ - Current: 8 RY + 16 XX/YY gates + 1 final RZ (many gates, complex interactions)          │
│                          │ - Prior successful: 8 RY + 8 entanglement gates + 8 RZ (balanced, cleaner structure)      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The problem is gate redundancy: the current program has too many entanglement paths (16   │
│                          │ XX/YY gates) causing overfitting on limited training data. Parameter economy matters      │
│                          │ critically here.                                                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ I propose:                                                                                │
│                          │ 1. Reduce entanglement gates from 16 to 8 by keeping only essential connectivity patterns │
│                          │ 2. Restore individual RZ rotations per qubit (not shared) to allow fine-grained phase     │
│                          │ control                                                                                   │
│                          │ 3. Focus on nearest-neighbor and diagonal connections, removing redundant cross-layer     │
│                          │ gates                                                                                     │
│                          │ 4. This reduces circuit complexity while maintaining expressiveness                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should improve worst_group_margin by enabling better separation on hard samples      │
│                          │ through clearer, more learnable structure.                                                │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0645                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5                                                     │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 0; deleted: 5; modified: 22;                                                       │
