│ patch_description        │ Insert a mid-circuit parity-shared rotation layer between the entanglement and phase      │
│                          │ layers in ANSATZ_SPEC. This allows the circuit to refine feature representations after    │
│                          │ entanglement using tightly-shared rotations (even/odd qubits share parameters), which     │
│                          │ boosts expressivity per parameter while improving margin separation on hard samples. The  │
│                          │ new layer adds only 2 distinct parameters (ry_mid_even/odd and rz_mid_even/odd collapse   │
│                          │ to 2 unique names), enabling better robust separation without parameter count explosion.  │
│                          │ Prior seeds showed this architecture tightens worst-group margins significantly.          │
