│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ improve_entanglement_diversity                                                            │
│ patch_description        │ The current program scores 0.46 vs. the prior best of 0.60, with significant degradation  │
│                          │ in validation accuracy (0.83 vs 0.97) and worst_group_margin (0.25 vs 0.32). The root     │
│                          │ cause is insufficient entanglement diversity and weak coupling structure.                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The current ANSATZ_SPEC has:                                                              │
│                          │ - Only 8 two-qubit gates (4 XX + 2 YY + 2 ZZ)                                             │
│                          │ - Limited long-range interactions (only 0-4 and 2-6)                                      │
│                          │ - Sparse diagonal coverage                                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This leads to underfitting on hard validation samples. The solution is to:                │
│                          │ 1. Increase entanglement density while maintaining parameter economy                      │
│                          │ 2. Add more long-range and cross-layer couplings                                          │
│                          │ 3. Use CZ gates (fixed, parameter-free) to add structural diversity without parameter     │
│                          │ count increase                                                                            │
│                          │ 4. Improve coverage of all qubit pairs to reduce worst-group margin                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new design keeps 7 distinct parameters (same as prior best) but distributes           │
│                          │ entanglement more effectively across the 8 qubits, ensuring the circuit can learn richer  │
│                          │ representations that generalize to harder validation cases.                               │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0638                                                                                   │
