                         Patch Metadata - Gen 59/80 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 2/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ enhanced_entanglement_for_worst_group_separation                                          │
│ patch_description        │ The worst_group_margin_mean of 0.32 is significantly lower than the overall               │
│                          │ validation_margin_mean of 0.64. This indicates certain validation subgroups (likely       │
│                          │ distinguished by hidden difficulty) are not being robustly separated.                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Since we cannot modify the readout calibration outside EVOLVE-BLOCK, we improve the       │
│                          │ circuit ansatz instead. The key is to add more diverse entanglement patterns that can     │
│                          │ capture correlations specific to hard samples.                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Current entanglement uses:                                                                │
│                          │ - 4 XX gates on nearest neighbors (all share one parameter)                               │
│                          │ - 2 YY gates on cross pairs (share one parameter)                                         │
│                          │ - 2 ZZ gates on long-range pairs (share one parameter)                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ We enhance this by:                                                                       │
│                          │ 1. Adding diagonal XX entanglement (wires [1,2], [3,4], [5,6], [0,7]) sharing a new       │
│                          │ parameter, creating more fine-grained correlations                                        │
│                          │ 2. Keeping the parameter count economy by sharing across identical gate types on diagonal │
│                          │ patterns                                                                                  │
│                          │ 3. This adds only 1 new parameter but provides richer expressiveness for distinguishing   │
│                          │ hard samples                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The diagonal XX pattern complements the nearest-neighbor XX by creating                   │
│                          │ intermediate-range entanglement that can capture sublattice structure and parity-based    │
│                          │ correlations naturally.                                                                   │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0601                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5                                                     │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 6; deleted: 0; modified: 2;                                                        │
