│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ compact_ansatz_with_enhanced_entanglement                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ The current program has 12 distinct parameters but achieves worse performance (0.54) than │
│                          │ the baseline with 7 parameters (0.60). The problem is parameter proliferation without     │
│                          │ sufficient expressiveness gains—per-pair XX gates (xx_01, xx_23, etc.) add overhead       │
│                          │ without improving worst-group separation.                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The strategy is to:                                                                       │
│                          │ 1. Return to the proven 7-parameter baseline structure (shared parameters for entangling  │
│                          │ layers)                                                                                   │
│                          │ 2. Enhance it with an additional strategic long-range ZZ coupling layer to capture        │
│                          │ non-local correlations that improve hard-sample separation                                │
│                          │ 3. Keep parameter count low (8 distinct params, +1 over baseline) to maintain parameter   │
│                          │ efficiency                                                                                │
│                          │ 4. Focus on robust separation rather than over-parameterization                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key insight: the baseline achieved better worst_group_margin (0.32 vs 0.31) with      │
│                          │ fewer params. Adding ONE extra parameter for additional entanglement is cheaper than the  │
│                          │ current 12-parameter design and more targeted to the hard-sample problem.                 │
